                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Game is unique and really enjoyable, though buggy. Has that 'one more turn' feeling. For a couple of years, the dev (a one-person team) made infrequent updates as life took precedence. But there hasn't been a serious update in a year. I would assume this game has been abandoned until there are new updates.\n\nAll of that said, I have a lot of respect for the dev. To come up with a good, new idea and even get it this far without a full team is notable. If you want a few hours of something different, I would say to get it, but don't expect a full experience.",
